5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We need facts, not feelings. I’m looking into last year’s fuel receipts and the mechanic’s remarks at the last service.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Minako, facts are vital, but they don’t heal the silence. I’ll check what other households said and our own past attempts to understand the friction.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I’ll examine the state of the car at handover and the hours of use recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I’ll review last year’s tax, insurance, and parking papers, plus the fuel receipts. We need the actual costs, not guesses.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m looking into the hours of use recorded in the diary and the spell of checking each other's figures.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, your approach is too vague. We need concrete data to fix the imbalance.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Fair point. But without understanding the social rot, the data just becomes ammunition. I’ll stick to my plan.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, I agree. Vague social theories won’t fix a broken routine. We need precise, verifiable data to establish a fair baseline for usage.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, agreed. Vague theories won’t balance the books. I need the hard numbers to see who’s actually driving.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to see where the time goes. The paperwork is exhausting.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, exhaustion is valid, but we need clarity. I’m checking fuel receipts and mechanic notes to see the true wear and tear.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
