35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, the receipts show two people bought over half the fuel. @Benjamin, the mechanic says short runs destroy brakes. We need to price that wear.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, the mechanic’s note confirms my fear: short runs breed resentment. @Shion, if two people dominate fuel, we’re not sharing, we’re subsidizing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, the diary confirms the imbalance. Saturdays are triple Tuesdays. I need a strict midweek protocol to ensure the car is actually usable for me.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, the 280,000 yen fixed cost is the baseline. @Benjamin, the fuel imbalance is obvious. We need a strict, data-driven split, not vague apologies.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Asuka, the diary shows Saturdays are triple Tuesdays. That imbalance makes the untangling so much harder.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, the mechanic’s warning means short trips cost more per kilometre. We must adjust the split to reflect actual wear, not just distance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, wear is real, but resentment is worse. I found that asking favours sours groups. We need a system where nobody has to beg for a ride.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
