43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, resentment is a luxury. I have the 280,000 yen baseline. We need a rigid, mathematical split based on actual usage, not feelings.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Benjamin, I saw the checking figures caused so much pain. I’m scared of that. Can we avoid it?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Daisuke, fear is natural, but ignoring the data guarantees failure. We must accept the numbers to stop the resentment.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
